      "id": "P001",
      "kind": "intro",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "text": "This is Working Draft's audio overview of the Impeachment Trial of Vice President Sara Duterte for July 22, 2026. This is a working reference, not an official Senate record.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "overview",
      "heading": "The big picture",
      "text": "NBI Director Melvin Matibag completed defense cross-examination and questioning by senator-judges. He described an unfinished inquiry that had narrowed its persons of interest but had not identified the person allegedly contracted to harm the President. The prosecution conducted no redirect, and the court excused him as its last Article Four witness.",
