    {
      "id": "P004",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The court's limits",
      "text": "The chair allowed cross-examination to continue but stopped argumentative or already-answered questions. He declined to strike Matibag's betrayal-of-public-trust answer, leaving it as witness testimony for the senator-judges to assess rather than adopting it as a court finding.",
